      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BANDIT CHLOE (6) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (22.30) at Q Lakeside in a Mix 5 over 390m. Top prospect. MRS. ESHAY (1) drifted back from the inside but sliced through to hit the frame when a 3 length third (20.10) at this track in P5. Expected to be in the finish again. DARK DISTANCE (2) has been hard to follow lately, running fifth (20.27) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Can turn it around this time. LAKODA FOCUS (5) is worth including after a top-three finish most recently.",
